# Precomputed visualization data (issue #7): built in CI, published as the
# `data` release asset, and delivered into files/iwac-visualizations/ by the
# admin "Pull latest data" job — never committed. Static map geometry lives in
# asset/geo/ (committed). Exceptions: sentiment-arbiter.json is externally
# sourced (sibling IWAC-sentiment-analysis study, not HF) and committed by
# the curator; scary-terms-events.json is the hand-curated historical-event
# annotation list for the Scary Terms trends view (issue #2). Both ride into
# the CI archive from the checkout instead of being generated;
# laicite-events.json is the same pattern for the Laïcité block (issue #14).
# All three ride into the CI archive from the checkout instead of being
# generated.
/asset/data/*
!/asset/data/sentiment-arbiter.json
!/asset/data/scary-terms-events.json
!/asset/data/laicite-events.json
